#====================================================================
# E600 — Conan CMakeToolchain 中 CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM 必须走 cache_variables
# 场景: 老项目（cmake_minimum_required < 3.5）在 Conan 配方中用 CMake 4.x 构建
#====================================================================

# ═══ Layer 0: 错误面 (Error Surface) ═══
id:                     E600
trigger_tool:           cmake
phase:                  configuration
error_signature:        Compatibility with CMake < 3\.5 has been removed|cmake_minimum_required.*VERSION.*2\.[0-9]|CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM=3\.5 to try configuring anyway

prescan_pattern:        cmake_minimum_required\s*\(\s*VERSION\s*(2\.|3\.[0-4])
prescan_globs:          CMakeLists.txt, *.cmake

# ═══ Layer 1: 识别层 (Recognition) ═══
severity:               3
category:               build-system, cmake, conan, compat
match_keywords:         CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM, CMakeToolchain, cache_variables, tc.variables, cmake_minimum_required, CMake 4, conan create, policy, jansson

# ═══ Layer 2: 根因层 (Root Cause) ═══
root_cause:             CMake 4.x 移除了对 cmake_minimum_required(<3.5) 的兼容（E103/E187 已记录裸 cmake 解法）。Conan 配方集成的隐藏坑：在 CMakeToolchain.generate() 里用 tc.variables["CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM"]="3.5" 写法不生效——tc.variables 生成的是 toolchain 文件内的 set() 语句，而 CMake 的 policy 版本检查发生在 project() 处理 toolchain 文件之前，等 toolchain set() 执行时检查早已失败退出。conan create 报 "Compatibility with CMake < 3.5 has been removed ... Error in build() method ... cmake.configure()"。本地裸 cmake 测试通过（-D 命令行传 cache 变量）但 conan create 失败，极易误判为环境差异。

affected_scope:         所有声明 cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 2.x/3.0-3.4) 且走 Conan CMakeToolchain 构建的库（jansson 2.14、woff2 1.0.2、brotli 早期版、olm 3.2.16 等，E103/E187/E600 同族）

# ═══ Layer 3: 处方层 (Prescription) ═══
rec_approach:           use-cache-variables
rec_description:        在 Conan 配方 generate() 中改用 CMakeToolchain 的 cache_variables 字典（生成 -D 命令行参数，先于 project() 生效）：tc.cache_variables["CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM"]="3.5"。与 tc.variables 的区别：cache_variables → cmake -DVAR=VAL（cache 变量，命令行阶段注入）；tc.variables → toolchain 文件 set(VAR VAL)（toolchain 处理时注入，对 policy 检查太晚）。实测 jansson 2.14（声明 2.8）改用 cache_variables 后 conan create 一次通过，213/213 测试全绿。
rec_command:            tc = CMakeToolchain(self); tc.cache_variables["CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM"] = "3.5"
verification_cmd:       python3 -c "from conans.conan import run; import sys; sys.argv=['conan','create','.','--user=ohpcd','--channel=stable','-pr:h=$HOME/.conan2/profiles/ohos-aarch64','-pr:b=$HOME/.conan2/profiles/ohos-aarch64','--build=missing']; run()" 2>&1 | tail -5

rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               manual
rec_priority:           1

# ═══ Layer 4: 证据层 (Evidence) ═══
evidence:               jansson 2.14 (PR #8050, 2026-09-04): tc.variables 写法 conan create 失败 "Compatibility with CMake < 3.5 has been removed"（conan-verify G2 FAIL）；改 cache_variables 后 G2 PASS + 213/213 ctest + test_package 通过。错误现象与 E187 裸 cmake 场景相同，但 E187 的 rec_command（命令行 -D）在 Conan 集成场景不可直接使用——配方不会拼 cmake 命令行，这正是本条目的增量。

related_ids:            E103, E187
pr_reference:           https://gitcode.com/OpenHarmonyPCDeveloper/build_in_harmonyos/merge_requests/8050
last_updated:           2026-09-04
author_agent:           B611
